# Insight (Blog / Posts)

Public blog surface lives under **`/insight`**. Content source: **Google Sheets** via `src/lib/googleSheets.ts` — not a local CMS DB.

## Domain

```ts
// src/types/article.ts
type Article = {
  id: string
  status: boolean
  highlight: boolean
  category: string
  slug: string
  title: string
  content: string
  excerpt: string
  coverImage: string
  createdAt: string
  updatedAt: string
  tags: string[]
}
```

- Published filter: `status === true`
- Featured: `highlight === true`
- Routes: `/insight` (list + filters) · `/insight/[category]/[slug]` (detail)
- Slug helpers: `src/lib/slugify.ts`

## Patterns

- **Server Components** fetch articles; client only for filters / interactive UI
- Keep list pagination / filter logic on the server when possible (`searchParams`)
- Card / recommendation components stay presentational — data comes from parent or `getArticles()`
- SEO: page `generateMetadata` + `BlogSchema` / article schemas — no fabricated dates or authors
- API routes under `src/app/api/articles/` are read-only helpers for the public site

## Do / Don't

- ✅ Reuse `NewsCard`, featured, recommendations — don't fork near-duplicates
- ✅ Sanitize / normalize category↔slug only in `lib/`
- ❌ Build an admin CRUD UI for articles unless explicitly requested
- ❌ Hardcode article bodies in components when Sheets already provides them
